======================================================================
1. HWPX file format
======================================================================

본 제품은 한컴의 HWP 문서 파일(.hwp) 공개 문서를 참고하여 개발하였습니다.

- The HWPX parser (docparser/parsers/hwpx.py) is original code written from Hancom's published file
  format documents (https://store.hancom.com/etc/hwpDownload.do). HWPX follows OWPML (KS X 6101).
- Hancom's conditions: the sentence above must appear in the product's user interface, manual,
  help and source code (whichever exist); the format documents themselves may only be redistributed
  unmodified; Hancom gives no warranty on the accuracy of derived works.
- Password-protected HWPX documents are not decrypted. Binary HWP (.hwp) is not supported.

======================================================================
2. Other file format specifications
======================================================================

- PowerPoint 97-2003 (.ppt): implemented from Microsoft's [MS-PPT] / [MS-ODRAW] Open Specifications
  (Microsoft Open Specifications Promise). No code copied.
- OpenDocument (.odt): OASIS ODF standard, read through odfpy.

